@UltimaExodus.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Health check
GET {{UltimaExodus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Current game state (creates the default save on a fresh database)
GET {{UltimaExodus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/state

### Move the party (this changes the saved position)
POST {{UltimaExodus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/move
Content-Type: application/json

{ "direction": "North" }

### Roster
GET {{UltimaExodus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/roster